# Documentation only; the application does not load this file.
# Run doppler setup once in the personal workplace (reads doppler.yaml).
# Inject keys with: doppler run -- uv run ...
# Env vars take precedence; frozen eval modules keep a dormant --env-file
# fallback only when the named var is unset (removed at next frozen-set bump).
# Stable process environment names (no values):
# CHESSLAB_OPENAI_API_KEY
# CHESSLAB_XAI_API_KEY
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY (optional routing studies; provision separately)
